    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.starter, mini.sessions\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI’ve been using mini.starter and mini.sessions and they work great. However, I’ve encountered one issue. When I delete a session from the starter screen, the starter screen does not update. Even after calling refresh on the starter, it still doesn’t update.\r\n\r\nPlease excuse any awkward expressions as I used a translation tool to write this.\r\nThank you for creating such a great program.\r\n\r\n### Neovim version\r\n\r\n0.10.1\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. run nvim\r\n2. Call require('mini.sessions).select('delete') on the starter screen to delete the session.\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n",
